From: Daniel Casota <dcasota@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Patch10101: 0001-FIPS-canister-binary-usage.patch (rebased for the 7.x crypto layout)

Linux 7.3-rc4 port of the Photon FIPS canister series.
See EXPERIMENTAL-7.3-rc4-FIPS.md for the per-patch decisions.
---
diff --git a/arch/x86/crypto/Makefile b/arch/x86/crypto/Makefile
index e04ff8718d6b6483a7f528ab0a93ff1ede54bd28..e7ea9383fbba84b3d8997403526a1069e50d7475 100644
